@GateHooks
Feature: Failing before step feature

    Before Feature:
        * Fail the gate step before the feature

    Scenario: Scenario after the failing step 1
        * Record the start of gate scenario 1
        * Record the end of gate scenario 1

    Scenario: Scenario after the failing step 2
        * Record the start of gate scenario 2
        * Record the end of gate scenario 2

    After Feature:
        * Record the gate step after the feature
